	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Once per day, you can assign the digger to dig at a specific location. After 8 hours, the digger creates a 5 foot by 5 foot entrance into the earth surface. The entrance is 15 feet deep if soil or 5 feet deep if stone. If more than one digger is assigned to the same task, progress on the task is either expedited (time taken is divided by the number of diggers) or accumulated (all the diggers add their progress together).</p><p>In addition, the digger can identify most any rock, mineral, geological feature, or common subterranean magical phenomenon.</p>",
